What are Bird Repellent Products?

Bird Repellent Products are a general term for various methods and tools used to eliminate or prevent harmful birds from landing, roosting, or nesting. These products are generally designed to address various problems caused by birds, such as health-related problems caused by harmful birds through their droppings (including histoplasmosis, cryptococcosis, and psittacosis), damage to property and equipment, and bird infestation of crops and orchards.

